    "detailed_description": "<h1>Buy the First Turnip Boy Game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/33e2177844ebd6c82f5ce27f0b16cdf6.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/33e2177844ebd6c82f5ce27f0b16cdf6.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/33e2177844ebd6c82f5ce27f0b16cdf6.mp4?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Turnip Boy is ready to commit more felonies in this comedic action-adventure game with roguelite elements.</strong> This time the career criminal is teaming up with the fearsome Pickled Gang to plan and execute the weirdest heist of all time! Shake down hostages, steal precious valuables, and explore the deep, dark depths and history of the Botanical Bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/953508ccad89818b5e5c0af0056eedd4.avif?t=1754519215\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A thrilling single-player adventure full of bank robbing, dark web browsing, and fuzz fighting!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/b7f2b7a276ed985429f267dedc22f04a.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/b7f2b7a276ed985429f267dedc22f04a.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/b7f2b7a276ed985429f267dedc22f04a.mp4?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelite elements to turnip the action.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/6312d4d647b1719c713b98e1117cdc86.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/6312d4d647b1719c713b98e1117cdc86.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An array of wacky weapons!</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/235fbfe15ce1f9b81eea42111cdfc0ef.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/235fbfe15ce1f9b81eea42111cdfc0ef.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Take on whoever the bank throws at you in intense shootouts, from security guards to elite veggie swat teams!</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/0654a568136a7eb86221cfc1cd17ee63.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/0654a568136a7eb86221cfc1cd17ee63.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Earn collectable hats to wear, new banger tracks to blast, and\u00a0discover a deeper history of Turnip Boy\u2019s world and how it came to be!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/33e2177844ebd6c82f5ce27f0b16cdf6.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/33e2177844ebd6c82f5ce27f0b16cdf6.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/33e2177844ebd6c82f5ce27f0b16cdf6.mp4?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Turnip Boy is ready to commit more felonies in this comedic action-adventure game with roguelite elements.</strong> This time the career criminal is teaming up with the fearsome Pickled Gang to plan and execute the weirdest heist of all time! Shake down hostages, steal precious valuables, and explore the deep, dark depths and history of the Botanical Bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/953508ccad89818b5e5c0af0056eedd4.avif?t=1754519215\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A thrilling single-player adventure full of bank robbing, dark web browsing, and fuzz fighting!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/b7f2b7a276ed985429f267dedc22f04a.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/b7f2b7a276ed985429f267dedc22f04a.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/b7f2b7a276ed985429f267dedc22f04a.mp4?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelite elements to turnip the action.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/6312d4d647b1719c713b98e1117cdc86.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/6312d4d647b1719c713b98e1117cdc86.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An array of wacky weapons!</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/235fbfe15ce1f9b81eea42111cdfc0ef.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/235fbfe15ce1f9b81eea42111cdfc0ef.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Take on whoever the bank throws at you in intense shootouts, from security guards to elite veggie swat teams!</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/0654a568136a7eb86221cfc1cd17ee63.poster.avif?t=1754519215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097230/extras/0654a568136a7eb86221cfc1cd17ee63.webm?t=1754519215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Earn collectable hats to wear, new banger tracks to blast, and\u00a0discover a deeper history of Turnip Boy\u2019s world and how it came to be!</p>",
    "short_description": "Turnip Boy is back! This time he\u2019s teaming up with the fearsome Pickled Gang to plan and execute the weirdest heist of all time. Shake down hostages, steal precious valuables, battle the fuzz, and use wacky tools bought off the dark web to move further into the vaults of the Botanical Bank.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cTurnip Boy Robs a Bank is a very good thing.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 The Jimquisition<br><br>\u201cBoiled to perfection\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Well-Played<br><br>\u201cTurnip Boy Robs a Bank might have changed genres, but big improvements to combat and a more jam-packed world revitalize the series.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 IGN<br>",
